WEBVTT

00:00:08,530 --> 00:00:19,090
Another practitioner is pushing for me to do missile toll. I have heard good things,

00:00:19,090 --> 00:00:24,210
but not sure if we can financially swing it right now. With the protocol you have me on,

00:00:24,210 --> 00:00:37,650
do you feel we can restore my health in time? So I think this person is choosing to do chemotherapy

00:00:38,210 --> 00:00:45,170
as well, so I don't go that I would add missile toll at this time. So yeah, I think this might be

00:00:45,170 --> 00:00:51,730
actually an older question too, but I think this is something that you could forego right now.

00:00:51,730 --> 00:00:59,330
This isn't something that I don't think you need to do.

